W28 = Personal Information Protection Law of the PRC (PIPL, 13th NPC
Standing Committee 30th session 2021-08-20 passed, effective
2021-11-01, 8 chapters 74 articles), official fulltext direct-captured
A-grade from cac.gov.cn (2021-08/20/c_1631050028355286.htm, source
note China NPC website; 1-try search + 1-get; the initial gov.cn
/xinwen content_5632486 URL guess 404'd - negative honestly recorded).
This closes the upstream-law chain: W19 (account-info rule), W23 (data
regulation) and W25 (children rule) all cite "personal information
protection law" as their parent statute - W28 captures that parent
fulltext itself.
key clauses consumed:
- art. 4 definition: PI = info recorded electronically or otherwise
  relating to identified/identifiable natural persons, EXCLUDING
  anonymized info; processing = collect/store/use/process/transmit/
  provide/publicize/delete full chain;
- art. 6 minimal necessity: explicit+reasonable purpose, directly
  related, least-impact means, collection limited to the minimum
  scope, no over-collection;
- art. 13 seven lawful bases (consent / contract necessity / statutory
  duty / public-health emergency / public-interest reporting /
  lawfully-published info / others);
- art. 14 consent informed-voluntary-explicit + RE-consent on change
  of purpose/means/kind; art. 15 convenient withdrawal channel;
- art. 16 no refusing products/services because the individual
  declines consent or withdraws it (processing that IS necessary for
  providing the product/service excepted) - member authorization face
  "no-consent-no-service" ban, layered with the W20 mini-program
  privacy gate (undeclared APIs disabled by platform) into two doors;
- art. 17 four notification items (identity+contact / purpose-means-
  kinds-retention / rights channel / others), change notification,
  rules public and easy to keep;
- art. 21 entrustment: supervision + no exceeding scope + return-or-
  delete on termination + no sub-delegation without consent;
- art. 24 automated decision-making: transparency + fair and just
  results + NO UNREASONABLE DIFFERENTIAL TREATMENT ON TRANSACTION
  PRICES (= big-data price-discrimination ban, FIRST direct statutory
  source; W10/W17/W23 three prior regulations now converge) + push/
  marketing must offer a non-personalized option OR a convenient
  rejection way + right to explanation and to refuse purely-automated
  decisions with major impact - P-47(5) entitlement "priority filter"
  and the 19.9 one-price canon at the highest statute level;
- art. 28-31 sensitive PI: biometric/religious/special-identity/
  medical-health/financial-account/location + PI of minors under 14;
  specific purpose + full necessity + strict protection + SEPARATE
  consent; art. 31 guardian consent + "shall formulate dedicated
  personal information processing rules" = upstream statute of W25
  child regulation (its art. 8 dedicated rules);
- art. 45-47 access/copy promptly + transfer path + correction +
  FIVE proactive deletion grounds; art. 50 convenient rights channel
  + reasoned refusal + litigation right;
- art. 51 six security measures (internal rules / classified mgmt /
  encryption+de-identification / access rights+training / incident
  plan / others);
- art. 54 PERIODIC COMPLIANCE AUDIT (upstream twin of the reconcile
  family); art. 55 PRE-EVENT PIA five triggers (sensitive PI /
  automated decision / entrust-provide-publicize / cross-border /
  other major impact) + art. 56 PIA report and records kept >= 3
  years (same shape as W23 art. 12);
- art. 57 breach response; art. 58 important-platform duties (scale
  threshold NOT met - honest note, duties like notification not
  waived); art. 66 penalties: warning+confiscation+<=1M CNY, severe
  <=50M CNY or 5% of last-year turnover + officer 100K-1M +
  officer ban - same magnitude tier as W11 minors regulation.
